Verse 5
1. God's love outpoured [D]at [A]Bethlehem,
[D]As [G]He came [D]down to [Em7]live as [A]men
And [G]draw our [D]sinful souls [A]to [Bm]Him:
[Bm7]God's [G]love outpoured [E]at [A]Bethlehem!

Verse 6
[D]2. [A]God's [G]love outpoured [D]upon [A]a [D]hill,
Where [G]loaves and fish [D]were [Em]made to fill.
[A]God's care [G]for us [D]endureth [Bm]still:
[Bm7]God's [G]love outpoured [A]upon a [G]hill!

Verse 7
[Em7]3. [A]God's [G]love outpoured [D]upon [A]the [D]sea,
To [G]calm the [D]storm, from [Em]fear to free.
[A]From [G]fear of hell [D]He [A]ransomed [Bm]me:
[Bm7]God's [G]love outpoured [Em]upon [A]the [G]sea!

Verse 8
[E]4. [A]God's [G]love outpoured [D]within [A]a [D]room,
Not long [G]before [D]the cross [Em]and [A7]tomb,
[A]To [G]us the Bride, [D]from Christ [F#m7]the [Bm]Groom:
God's [G]love outpoured [Em]within [A]a [G]room!

Verse 9
[Em]5. [A]God's [G]love outpoured [D]from [A]Calvary:
[D]The [G]Son of [D]God in [Em]agony.
[A]Yet [G]death gave way [D]to [A]victory:
[Bm7]God's [G]love outpoured [Em]from [A]Calvary!

Verse 10
[Bm7]6. [A]God's [G]love outpours [D]on [A]us today;
[D]His [A7]Word [G]is clear [D]to show [Em]the [E]Way.
[A]So [G]turn to Him, [D]don't [A]turn [Bm7]away:
[Bm7]God's [G]love outpours [Em]on [A]us today!
